<header><p class="enc-kicker">Place · river</p><h1 class="enc-title">Pra River</h1><p class="enc-meta">Also known as River Pra</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Pra is a river in southern <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ghana">Ghana</a> flowing into the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/gulf-of-guinea">Gulf of Guinea</a>. The 1831 treaty between the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ashanti-empire">Ashanti Empire</a> and the British recognised it as the southern boundary of Asante influence. This settlement curtailed Asante's ambitions on the coast.</p></div>
